# NeolyxOS boot image program list
#
# Every program installed on the boot image is listed here, one per line:
#
#   <build folder>   <built file in that folder>   <path on the image>
#
# build_all.sh runs `make -C <build folder>` and checks the built file;
# rebuild_image.sh copies it to <path on the image>. Streams add their own
# programs here (append-only, see the beta plan, section 3.4) instead of
# editing the scripts.
#
# Rules (checked by scripts/lib/image_apps.sh; a bad line stops the build):
#   - folders are relative to the repository root and built files to their
#     folder, with no "..",
#     no leading "/" and only letters, digits, "_", "-", ".", "/";
#   - image paths start with /apps/ or /System/ and use the same characters;
#   - an image path appears only once.
#
# Owner of this file: stream S10. Lines below the S10 block are owned by
# the stream that added them.

# --- S10: tests installed for in-QEMU regression runs ---
tests/userland/ticker      ticker      /apps/ticker
tests/userland/fdtest      fdtest      /apps/fdtest
tests/userland/shmtest     shmtest     /apps/shmtest
tests/userland/ipc_test    ipc_test    /apps/ipc_test
tests/userland/fbtest      fbtest      /apps/fbtest
tests/userland/wintest     wintest     /apps/wintest
tests/userland/nxwtest     nxwtest     /apps/nxwtest
tests/userland/nxuitest    nxuitest    /apps/nxuitest
tests/userland/memstress   memstress   /apps/memstress
tests/userland/cpuhog      cpuhog      /apps/cpuhog
tests/userland/classtest   classtest   /apps/classtest
tests/userland/nettest     nettest     /apps/nettest
tests/userland/memprobe    memprobe    /apps/memprobe

# --- S2: built-in apps that run as their own process ---
# REOX apps (their Makefile lists REOX_SRCS) need reoxc and the REOX
# runtime: build_all.sh finds them through REOX_ROOT (sdk/toolchain.env).
# The desktop launches these by name (g_disk_apps in desktop_shell.c).
desktop/apps/Calculator.app   bin/calculator   /apps/Calculator
# Built-in desktop views run by the view host (desktop/viewhost). The
# window title ("Path") is the name the shell launches and focuses.
desktop/viewhost              files/Files      /apps/Path
